=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"2nd Wind Heating and Cooling &amp; Indoor Air Quality Team in Columbia\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/10/An-employee-group-photo-of-the-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-team-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left mt-0 h-decorator--white h-decorator-md h-decorator\"><br>Comprehensive HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Home Generator Services in Elgin, SC</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a2f35af1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Heating and Cooling in Elgin</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Builder-grade HVAC equipment is built to a price, and in this climate it commonly comes due in its second decade. When an Elgin system starts failing, our <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc\">cooling services</a> and <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc\">heating services</a> diagnose whether the problem is the equipment or the installation around it, since undersized ducts and casual refrigerant work follow some subdivisions for years. Replacements are sized by load calculation rather than by reading the old nameplate, and homes considering efficiency upgrades can weigh a <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc/heat-pumps\">heat pump</a> against their current setup with real numbers.</p>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Plumbing and Drains in Elgin</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Newer plumbing fails less often but not never, and Elgin&#8217;s mix includes rural properties with older systems and wells. Our licensed <a href=\"/services/plumbing-columbia-sc\">plumbing services</a> handle everything from water heaters reaching the end of their first decade to fixture and supply-line failures, and our <a href=\"/services/drains-columbia-sc\">drain services</a> resolve clogs and inspect lines on camera, which is also the smart step before purchasing any home in a fast-moving market.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Home Generators in Elgin</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Storms moving up the I-20 corridor drop trees on lines in every season, and outages on the rural edges of Kershaw County can run long. Our <a href=\"/services/home-generators-columbia-sc\">home generator services</a> install and maintain standby units that carry the house automatically until the grid returns.</p>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How We Work in Elgin</strong></h5>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Diagnosis first, video second, price third, work last. Cloud 10 members through our <a href=\"/maintenance\">maintenance plans</a> get seasonal tune-ups on autopilot and priority scheduling when the first heat wave stacks the calendar.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-4\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs</h2>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">My Elgin home&#8217;s original HVAC system is about 12 years old. Should I budget for replacement?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Start budgeting, but replace on evidence rather than age alone. A diagnostic visit establishes the equipment&#8217;s actual condition, and we show you what we find so a system with life left keeps running and one that is failing gets replaced on your schedule instead of in August.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Is it worth having new-construction ductwork checked?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes. Duct sizing and sealing quality vary between builders, and leaks or restrictions cap a system&#8217;s performance from day one. A duct evaluation tells you whether the house is getting the airflow it was sold with.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Should I get a sewer camera inspection before buying a house in Elgin?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a fast-growing market with homes changing hands quickly, yes. The inspection is inexpensive relative to the surprise it prevents, and you keep the footage as a record of the line&#8217;s condition.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long does a standby generator installation take in Elgin?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Once the site visit sets sizing, fuel, and placement, the installation itself typically completes within a few days of work, plus permitting and inspection timelines. We schedule the sequence up front so there are no open-ended gaps.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What areas near Elgin does 2nd Wind serve?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lugoff and Camden, both within about ten miles, along with the surrounding Kershaw County communities.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Growing towns deserve service companies that diagnose instead of assume. Call 2nd Wind, book online, or use the 24/7 chat, and get your Elgin home&#8217;s systems evaluated on video.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"our-promise container should-overlap \" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technicians reviewing items on a tablet device\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/06/Two-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technicians-reviewing-items-on-a-tablet-device.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Experts in HVAC, Plumbing &#038; Indoor Air Quality in Columbia and the Surrounding Midlands Region</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">For 2nd Wind HVAC in Columbia, SC, we prioritize a timely response to all customer inquiries and service requests, ensuring your comfort is never compromised. With our 24/7 emergency HVAC and plumbing services, we are always available to provide immediate assistance. Whether you need HVAC repair, plumbing solutions, or indoor air quality services, our team is dedicated to delivering fast, reliable support so you&#8217;re never left waiting when it matters most. Choose 2nd Wind HVAC for prompt, professional care in Columbia, SC.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5 has-grad-white-to-gray-gradient-background\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Certifications and Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 5;\" data-logo-count=\"5\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--start\" aria-label=\"See previous\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:5;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE)\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png 252w, /images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE-150x150.png 150w\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div